   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Transitive verbs",
     "texto": [
      "A transitive verb usually takes an object that completes the action: **menata dagangan** (\"to arrange the goods\"), **menjual hasil panen** (\"to sell the harvest\"). The object answers \"what?\" or \"whom?\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Actions with an object",
     "texto": [
      "In Indonesian, the subject is usually followed by the verb and then the object. The verb does not change according to the person: **saya menata dagangan**, **mereka menata dagangan**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
